    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap MAVLink v2 Protocol Encoder &amp; Streaming Decoder. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>MAVLink v2 Frame Specification: Header: [0xFD] + [Payload Len 1B] + [Incompat Flags 1B] + [Compat Flags 1B] + [Seq 1B] + [Sys ID 1B] + [Comp ID 1B] + [Msg ID 3B (Little-Endian)] Payload: [Payload N B] Checksum: [16-bit CRC-X25 over (Header_without_STX + Payload + CRC_Extra)] </para>
    </detaileddescription>
